                            "Horizontal packed column S-2 on Silicium-Staith still SS-5 is 14 C above its 104 C SiCl4 kettle limit while a 2 kHz well thermocouple races the steam-orifice transmitter. The 920 kg/h steam valve is still open; cutting it to 480 kg/h brings the kettle legal. Tray-7 packing collar, previously cracked, then dumps liquor 15.5 ms after the gate, still inside the 42 ms window.",